{
  "file": "Guidance for national",
  "page": 140,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        231.10589599609375,
        21.884788513183594,
        277.722412109375,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "Guidance for",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        277.722412109375,
        21.884788513183594,
        349.1717834472656,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "national tuberculosis",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        351.4517822265625,
        21.884788513183594,
        407.7772216796875,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "programmes on",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        407.7772216796875,
        21.884788513183594,
        518.984130859375,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "the management of tuberculosis",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        518.984130859375,
        21.884788513183594,
        557.1551513671875,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "in children",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        81.5599365234375,
        144.39138793945312,
        98.2879409790039
      ],
      "text": "Procedure",
      "font": "Arial-BoldItalicMT",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        105.2994384765625,
        513.380126953125,
        118.65093994140625
      ],
      "text": "Gastric aspiration can be carried out as an inpatient procedure first thing in the morning",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        121.29595947265625,
        513.506591796875,
        134.6474609375
      ],
      "text": "when the child wakes up, at the child’s bedside or in a procedure room on the ward",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        137.29248046875,
        513.46044921875,
        150.64398193359375
      ],
      "text": "(if one is available), or as an outpatient procedure (provided that the facility is properly",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        153.28900146484375,
        513.4260864257812,
        166.6405029296875
      ],
      "text": "equipped). The child should have fasted for at least 4 hours (infants for 3 hours) before",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        169.2855224609375,
        156.83387756347656,
        182.63702392578125
      ],
      "text": "the procedure.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        193.80340576171875,
        224.30438232421875,
        207.1549072265625
      ],
      "text": "1.\t Find an assistant to help.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        215.80291748046875,
        359.992919921875,
        229.1544189453125
      ],
      "text": "2.\t Prepare all equipment before starting the procedure.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        237.80242919921875,
        513.3455200195312,
        251.1539306640625
      ],
      "text": "3.\t Position the child on his or her back or side. The assistant should help to hold the",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88739776611328,
        253.7989501953125,
        129.0843963623047,
        267.15045166015625
      ],
      "text": "child.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        275.7984619140625,
        513.4259643554688,
        289.14996337890625
      ],
      "text": "4.\t Measure the distance between the nose and stomach, to estimate how far the tube",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88739776611328,
        291.79498291015625,
        328.24139404296875,
        305.146484375
      ],
      "text": "will need to be inserted to reach the stomach.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        313.79449462890625,
        301.6073913574219,
        327.14599609375
      ],
      "text": "5.\t Attach a syringe to the nasogastric tube.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        335.79400634765625,
        513.426025390625,
        349.1455078125
      ],
      "text": "6.\t Gently insert the nasogastric tube through the nose and advance it into the stomach.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        357.79351806640625,
        513.4144897460938,
        371.14501953125
      ],
      "text": "7.\t Withdraw (aspirate) gastric contents (2–5 ml) using the syringe attached to the",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88739776611328,
        373.7900085449219,
        186.59588623046875,
        387.1415100097656
      ],
      "text": "nasogastric tube.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        395.7895202636719,
        513.4029541015625,
        409.1410217285156
      ],
      "text": "8.\t To check that the position of the tube is correct, test the gastric contents with litmus",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88739776611328,
        411.7860107421875,
        513.4605102539062,
        425.13751220703125
      ],
      "text": "paper: blue litmus turns red in response to the acidic stomach contents. (This can",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88739776611328,
        427.7825012207031,
        513.35693359375,
        441.1340026855469
      ],
      "text": "also be checked by pushing some air (e.g. 3–5 ml) from the syringe into the stomach",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88739776611328,
        443.77899169921875,
        355.933349609375,
        457.1304931640625
      ],
      "text": "and listening with a stethoscope over the stomach.)",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        465.77850341796875,
        513.4833984375,
        479.1300048828125
      ],
      "text": "9.\t If no fluid is aspirated, insert 5–10 ml sterile water or normal saline and attempt to",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88739776611328,
        481.7749938964844,
        513.4834594726562,
        495.1264953613281
      ],
      "text": "aspirate again. If still unsuccessful, repeat the procedure. (Even if the nasogastric",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88739776611328,
        497.771484375,
        513.4375,
        511.12298583984375
      ],
      "text": "tube is in an incorrect position and water or normal saline is inserted into the airways,",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88739776611328,
        513.7680053710938,
        500.3043518066406,
        527.1195068359375
      ],
      "text": "the risk of adverse events is still very small). Do not repeat more than three times.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        535.7675170898438,
        376.6219177246094,
        549.1190185546875
      ],
      "text": "10.\tWithdraw the gastric contents (ideally at least 5–10 ml).",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        557.7670288085938,
        510.2060241699219,
        571.1185302734375
      ],
      "text": "11.\tTransfer gastric fluid from the syringe into a sterile container (sputum collection cup).",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        579.7664794921875,
        513.4375,
        593.1179809570312
      ],
      "text": "12.\tAdd an equal volume of sodium bicarbonate solution to the specimen (in order to",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88739776611328,
        595.7630004882812,
        508.1820068359375,
        609.114501953125
      ],
      "text": "neutralize the acidic gastric contents and so prevent destruction of tubercle bacilli).",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        619.4639282226562,
        196.38739013671875,
        636.1919555664062
      ],
      "text": "After the procedure",
      "font": "Arial-BoldItalicMT",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        643.2034301757812,
        513.4375610351562,
        656.554931640625
      ],
      "text": "1.\t Wipe the specimen container with alcohol/chlorhexidine to prevent cross-infection",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88739776611328,
        659.1998901367188,
        218.12887573242188,
        672.5513916015625
      ],
      "text": "and label the container.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        681.1994018554688,
        296.2713623046875,
        694.5509033203125
      ],
      "text": "2.\t Fill out the laboratory requisition forms.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        703.1989135742188,
        513.3916625976562,
        716.5504150390625
      ],
      "text": "3.\t Transport the specimen (in a cool box) to the laboratory for processing as soon as",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88739776611328,
        719.1954345703125,
        225.60389709472656,
        732.5469360351562
      ],
      "text": "possible (within 4 hours).",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        741.1948852539062,
        513.3453979492188,
        754.54638671875
      ],
      "text": "4.\t If it is likely to take more than 4 hours for the specimens to be transported, place",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88739776611328,
        757.19140625,
        399.0929870605469,
        770.5429077148438
      ],
      "text": "them in the refrigerator (4–8 °C) and store until transported.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        779.19091796875,
        277.3424072265625,
        792.5424194335938
      ],
      "text": "5.\t Give the child his or her usual food.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        553.0839233398438,
        805.8439331054688,
        586.4439086914062,
        835.8439331054688
      ],
      "text": "121",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 20.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    }
  ]
}